@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UML时序图——并发预约、幂等与状态一致性

actor "买家A" as A
actor "买家B" as B
participant "Web前端" as Web
participant "预约控制器" as Controller
participant "幂等服务" as Idempotency
participant "预约领域服务" as Trade
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "通知服务" as Notify

par 买家A提交 requestId=A-001
  A -> Web : 点击预约
  Web -> Controller : POST /reservations\n(A-001, productId)
  Controller -> Idempotency : 查询(A-001)
  Idempotency --> Controller : 未处理
  Controller -> Trade : reserve(buyerA, productId)
  Trade -> DB : BEGIN
  Trade -> DB : 条件更新商品\nPUBLISHED -> RESERVED
  DB --> Trade : 更新1行
  Trade -> DB : 插入预约与价格快照
  Trade -> DB : 插入操作日志
  Trade -> DB : COMMIT
  Trade --> Controller : 预约成功
else 买家B几乎同时提交 requestId=B-001
  B -> Web : 点击预约
  Web -> Controller : POST /reservations\n(B-001, productId)
  Controller -> Idempotency : 查询(B-001)
  Idempotency --> Controller : 未处理
  Controller -> Trade : reserve(buyerB, productId)
  Trade -> DB : BEGIN
  Trade -> DB : 条件更新商品\nPUBLISHED -> RESERVED
  DB --> Trade : 更新0行
  Trade -> DB : ROLLBACK
  Trade --> Controller : 状态冲突：已被预约
end

Controller -> Idempotency : 保存A-001处理结果
Controller -> Notify : 发布预约成功事件
Notify -> DB : 写入双方站内通知(eventKey唯一)
Controller --> Web : 200 + 预约详情
Web --> A : 显示预约成功
Controller --> Web : 409 + 当前商品状态
Web --> B : 显示已被预约

== 网络重试 ==
A -> Web : 再次点击/自动重试
Web -> Controller : POST /reservations (A-001)
Controller -> Idempotency : 查询(A-001)
Idempotency --> Controller : 返回首次成功结果
Controller --> Web : 原预约详情（不重复写库/通知）
@enduml
